  "description": "RAND NEW PROPERTY TO LET at 6 St. Bridget's Court, Drumlish, Co. Longford \n\nSpanking brand new, two-bedroom semi-detached bungalow, located in the heart of the thriving village of Drumlish. A hugely sought-after area within the village, just a few minutes drive off the N4 and Longford Town.. Along the Cavan-Longford bus route, all essential amenities are located within easy reach of the property. The village boasts supermarkets, service station, library, community sports centre, post office, bars and restaurants/take-aways.\n\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hall, open plan living-kitchen area, two bedrooms and a family bathroom.\n\n**References in Advance: Strict Vetting & Screening of potential tenants in place. Previous landlord reference etc. **   \n\n*Please note, due to a high level of demand in the rental sector, we cannot guarantee viewings and/or a positive outcome to the huge number of enquiries we receive on a daily basis* ",
